    "intro_narrative": "Welcome to the forgotten Sanctum of Eldoria. You are an apprentice mage who has accidentally wandered into the archmage's forbidden laboratory. The door has sealed itself shut behind you, and the magical wards are slowly draining the oxygen from the room. To escape, you must reawaken the ancient magical artifacts scattered around the room and reconstruct the master's final spell. The magic flows in mysterious ways, and many objects will only reveal their true nature when infused with the energy of others. Pay close attention to how the magical essence must be channeled between the relics. Time is running out.",
    "narrative_style": "fantasy"
